==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|врѣ́мя||ru-PRO}} {{q|attested as a common misspelling, influenced by {{cog|cu|врѣмѧ}}}}.

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*wert-}}
{{bor+|ru|cu|врѣмѧ}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*vermę}} < {{m|sla-pro||*vertmen}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*wertmen}}. Displaced native {{cog|orv|веремѧ}}. Cognate with {{cog|sa|वर्त्मन्|tr=vártman||track, course}}.

See also [[w:pleophony|pleophony]] (CeRC > CeReC) and [[w:liquid metathesis|liquid metathesis]] (CeRC > CReC, CRēC).

